WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.110 --> 00:00:06.030
On an ordinary day in 1991, a young man known
by the initials J.S. went on a hike with four

00:00:06.030 --> 00:00:09.730
of his friends on the wooded outskirts of
their small town.

00:00:09.730 --> 00:00:14.969
Everything seemed perfectly normal until J.S.
began to feel a strange sense of familiarity,

00:00:14.969 --> 00:00:17.200
like he had been in this spot before.

00:00:17.200 --> 00:00:20.520
He couldn’t shake this weird feeling, but
thought nothing more of it.

00:00:20.520 --> 00:00:24.340
Little did he know that this was a sign of
deadly things to come.

00:00:24.340 --> 00:00:29.160
Several hours after first experiencing that
sense of deja vu, J.S. was found by the side

00:00:29.160 --> 00:00:34.410
of the road, covered in cuts and scratches,
with his friends nowhere to be found.

00:00:34.410 --> 00:00:41.370
This is the story of SCP - 939, an unforgettable
monster that you’ll never remember.

00:00:41.370 --> 00:00:45.260
There was no way for J.S. to know that the
unsettling feeling he felt and the horrors

00:00:45.260 --> 00:00:51.060
that followed it were the result of an experiment
conducted by the SCP Foundation, an experiment

00:00:51.060 --> 00:00:54.510
with deadly unforeseen consequences.

00:00:54.510 --> 00:00:59.989
J.S. and his friends were exposed to a substance
known only as AMN-C227 as part of a series

00:00:59.989 --> 00:01:05.519
of tests performed by the SCP Foundation intended
to determine the effectiveness of this substance

00:01:05.519 --> 00:01:08.460
as a deliberate amnestic.

00:01:08.460 --> 00:01:14.271
Dealing with as many mysterious, secret creatures
and objects as they do, the SCP Foundation

00:01:14.271 --> 00:01:19.409
has long needed a way to tamper with the memories
of those exposed to the foundation’s various

00:01:19.409 --> 00:01:24.670
prisoners and test subjects, and, when the
foundation discovered AMN-C227, it seemed

00:01:24.670 --> 00:01:27.650
like it might be perfect for this purpose.

00:01:27.650 --> 00:01:31.170
So where did AMN-C227 come from?

00:01:31.170 --> 00:01:35.330
Over a year before the incident with J.S.
and his friends, the SCP Foundation captured

00:01:35.330 --> 00:01:36.970
SCP-939.

00:01:36.970 --> 00:01:42.790
SCP-939 is a species of endothermic predators
that live and hunt in packs.

00:01:42.790 --> 00:01:48.939
They are designated Keter class, and regarded
as highly dangerous and hostile to human life.

00:01:48.939 --> 00:01:54.990
Native to caves, they have no eyes, translucent
red skin, and stand at an average of 2.2 meters

00:01:54.990 --> 00:01:57.880
tall, with an average weight of 250 kg.

00:01:57.880 --> 00:02:04.240
They have four limbs, each ending in three-fingered
claws and a fourth opposable digit resembling

00:02:04.240 --> 00:02:05.550
a thumb.

00:02:05.550 --> 00:02:09.789
In addition to their sharp claws, their mouths
are filled with red, fang-like teeth that

00:02:09.789 --> 00:02:12.520
reach up to 6 cm in length.

00:02:12.520 --> 00:02:17.760
In place of their absent eyes, they have light-sensitive
spots running along their backs, which are

00:02:17.760 --> 00:02:22.400
covered in spines believed to detect changes
in air pressure and flow.

00:02:22.400 --> 00:02:27.730
In addition to their many other terrifying
attributes, the internal anatomy of SCP-939

00:02:27.730 --> 00:02:29.900
poses a biological mystery.

00:02:29.900 --> 00:02:33.690
These creatures have no circulatory system
and no digestive tract.

00:02:33.690 --> 00:02:38.480
That’s right, in spite of being predators
seemingly acting on a need to feed, they have

00:02:38.480 --> 00:02:39.569
no stomach.

00:02:39.569 --> 00:02:44.150
Instead, when they eat their food builds up
in their respiratory system until its presence

00:02:44.150 --> 00:02:47.940
inhibits function, and then it is regurgitated.

00:02:47.940 --> 00:02:53.060
In spite of being a creature that should not,
under any logical conditions, be able to live,

00:02:53.060 --> 00:02:58.989
SCP-939 continues to persist, and is even
capable of giving birth to live young after

00:02:58.989 --> 00:03:01.690
a gestation period of 12 months.

00:03:01.690 --> 00:03:05.700
The SCP Foundation was able to study a litter
of these young that were born in captivity

00:03:05.700 --> 00:03:10.830
in September of 1992, though the creatures
remain just as much of a scientific mystery

00:03:10.830 --> 00:03:13.750
as they were upon first discovery.

00:03:13.750 --> 00:03:18.580
Everything about them seems to defy the logic
of the natural world - which, to be fair,

00:03:18.580 --> 00:03:21.220
is really nothing new for the Foundation.

00:03:21.220 --> 00:03:27.099
The respiratory system of SCP-939 was found
to exhale small traces of an airborne amnestic

00:03:27.099 --> 00:03:31.000
substance, given the name AMN-C227.

00:03:31.000 --> 00:03:35.159
This compound blocks the formation of memories
for the duration of exposure to it, plus a

00:03:35.159 --> 00:03:39.100
thirty minute period following the exposure,
give or take a few minutes.

00:03:39.100 --> 00:03:44.129
It is colorless, odorless, tasteless, and
completely undetectable in the bloodstream

00:03:44.129 --> 00:03:46.489
after only 60 minutes.

00:03:46.489 --> 00:03:52.390
AMN-C227 was approved for use as a Class C
Amnestic by the SCP Foundation in 1990 following

00:03:52.390 --> 00:03:53.700
some initial tests.

00:03:53.700 --> 00:03:58.610
However, after one particular incident involving
a young man and his friends, the official

00:03:58.610 --> 00:04:02.000
use of AMN-C227 was suspended.

00:04:02.000 --> 00:04:07.290
J.S. and three of his four friends were previously
given a dose of AMN-C227, though the details

00:04:07.290 --> 00:04:11.610
of why they were given the amnestic have since
been stricken from the record.

00:04:11.610 --> 00:04:17.079
Several months after being exposed to AMN-C227,
J.S. and friends went out on their ill-fated

00:04:17.079 --> 00:04:18.099
hiking trip.

00:04:18.099 --> 00:04:21.979
While hiking, J.S. was suddenly overcome with
a sense of deja vu.

00:04:21.979 --> 00:04:25.539
When he mentioned it to his friends, three
of them agreed that they felt it too.

00:04:25.539 --> 00:04:30.610
One of the group, another young man - who
had not been exposed to AMN-C227 - was uncomfortable

00:04:30.610 --> 00:04:33.099
and decided to go home.

00:04:33.099 --> 00:04:36.379
J.S. and the remaining three members of the
group made the choice to stay in the woods

00:04:36.379 --> 00:04:41.110
and try to determine what was triggering the
unusual feeling of familiarity.

00:04:41.110 --> 00:04:45.599
As they got closer and closer to a large cave
near the hiking trail, the sense of having

00:04:45.599 --> 00:04:49.169
been there before grew stronger and stronger.

00:04:49.169 --> 00:04:54.919
Armed with only one flashlight and a foolish
curiosity, the four went inside the cave.

00:04:54.919 --> 00:05:00.550
They made their way deeper and deeper into
the darkness, not knowing why they felt this

00:05:00.550 --> 00:05:02.639
way or what they might find inside.

00:05:02.639 --> 00:05:07.259
None of the group could explain just what
felt so familiar, only that the further they

00:05:07.259 --> 00:05:10.949
made their way into the cave, the more pronounced
the feeling became.

00:05:10.949 --> 00:05:14.939
It was getting late, and they knew they should
have been afraid to venture so deep into a

00:05:14.939 --> 00:05:20.770
cave with only one light source and no knowledge
of what lay inside, but still they pressed

00:05:20.770 --> 00:05:21.770
on.

00:05:21.770 --> 00:05:25.020
One of the group remarked that they should
turn back, but the others refused to listen.

00:05:25.020 --> 00:05:28.740
They wanted to know what they were getting
close to, what was drawing them deeper and

00:05:28.740 --> 00:05:30.479
deeper into the cave.

00:05:30.479 --> 00:05:33.969
Unfortunately for them, they would get their
answer.

00:05:33.969 --> 00:05:38.939
In the heart of the cave was a pack of SCP-939,
waiting patiently for their prey to wander

00:05:38.939 --> 00:05:40.500
into their domain.

00:05:40.500 --> 00:05:44.310
There are no witnesses to account for what
exactly happened to J.S. and his companions,

00:05:44.310 --> 00:05:48.439
but we can reasonably piece the events together
from what happened after.

00:05:48.439 --> 00:05:52.129
Once the friends reached the heart of the
cave, the creatures were on them in seconds,

00:05:52.129 --> 00:05:55.569
raking them with their sharp claws and biting
with their fangs.

00:05:55.569 --> 00:06:00.370
SCP-939 are larger and stronger than most
people, so it was probably not much of a fight.

00:06:00.370 --> 00:06:05.059
However, while his friends were being devoured,
J.S. was somehow able to scramble out of the

00:06:05.059 --> 00:06:08.409
cave and make his way into the woods in search
of help.

00:06:08.409 --> 00:06:12.469
Under the influence of the AMN-C227 that had
built up in the cave from the presence of

00:06:12.469 --> 00:06:18.039
the pack of SCP-939, J.S. lost a large portion
of his memory of the event.

00:06:18.039 --> 00:06:22.680
He found himself on the side of the highway
late at night, seriously injured and his clothes

00:06:22.680 --> 00:06:23.680
ripped.

00:06:23.680 --> 00:06:27.409
An officer found him there, and asked him
to stay still and remain calm until an ambulance

00:06:27.409 --> 00:06:28.740
could arrive.

00:06:28.740 --> 00:06:33.080
J.S. was still in a panic and attempted to
run away from the officer, begging to be released

00:06:33.080 --> 00:06:34.460
so that he could get away.

00:06:34.460 --> 00:06:39.649
He babbled incoherently about the color red,
screaming over and over again about the “red,”

00:06:39.649 --> 00:06:43.319
though when prompted he could not explain
what the “red” he was screaming about

00:06:43.319 --> 00:06:44.340
referred to.

00:06:44.340 --> 00:06:46.020
His friends were not with him.

00:06:46.020 --> 00:06:49.919
Just as the officer managed to calm J.S.,
the ambulance arrived.

00:06:49.919 --> 00:06:54.939
Its flashing red lights sent him into another
frenzy, and he attempted to escape custody,

00:06:54.939 --> 00:06:57.319
claiming that the red lights were “going
to get” him.

00:06:57.319 --> 00:07:01.000
The official police report described J.S.
as perhaps being under the influence of a

00:07:01.000 --> 00:07:02.779
powerful hallucinogen.

00:07:02.779 --> 00:07:07.649
That he was just having a “bad trip,”
but the SCP foundation knew better.

00:07:07.649 --> 00:07:11.800
The foundation conducted an interview with
J.S. about his experience, and determined

00:07:11.800 --> 00:07:15.270
that SCP-939 was certainly involved.

00:07:15.270 --> 00:07:19.589
As part of their cover-up effort, they strongly
implicated J.S. in the disappearance and death

00:07:19.589 --> 00:07:20.679
of his friends.

00:07:20.679 --> 00:07:24.740
He was convicted of manslaughter, though the
bodies of his friends were never found.

00:07:24.740 --> 00:07:29.099
It is rumored that the SCP Foundation hired
him on a prison work release program, and

00:07:29.099 --> 00:07:34.909
that he now works as a member of the janitorial
staff at one of the Foundation’s facilities.

00:07:34.909 --> 00:07:40.120
This incident led to the suspension of the
use of AMN-C227, as it revealed some vital

00:07:40.120 --> 00:07:43.509
and disturbing information about the compound’s
side effects.

00:07:43.509 --> 00:07:48.830
After exposure to AMN-C227, a person who found
themselves exposed to it again would experience

00:07:48.830 --> 00:07:53.839
a sense of familiarity, and feel compelled
to investigate the source of this feeling.

00:07:53.839 --> 00:07:59.319
Essentially, anyone treated with AMN-C227
and not made aware of the existence - and

00:07:59.319 --> 00:08:04.969
danger - of SCP-939 would become a perfect
victim, primed to be attracted to dens of

00:08:04.969 --> 00:08:07.149
SCP-939.

00:08:07.149 --> 00:08:11.309
It is likely that this side effect is not
a coincidence, but rather a deliberate hunting

00:08:11.309 --> 00:08:15.889
tactic designed to attract prey that had somehow
managed to escape.

00:08:15.889 --> 00:08:20.830
With no memory of their attack at the hands
of SCP-939, this previous intended prey would

00:08:20.830 --> 00:08:25.629
find themselves drawn to the same den or even
a new one, not knowing that they were walking

00:08:25.629 --> 00:08:27.659
back into near certain death.

00:08:27.659 --> 00:08:33.530
While the SCP foundation suspended the use
of AMN-C227 as a Class C amnestic, they did

00:08:33.530 --> 00:08:38.139
recruit a team of SCP field operatives to
take advantage of this side effect.

00:08:38.139 --> 00:08:43.919
This team of operatives was deliberately administered
a dose of AMN-C227 and briefed on its effects,

00:08:43.919 --> 00:08:48.670
as well as the dangers of following the feeling
of deja vu should it surface in the field.

00:08:48.670 --> 00:08:53.610
These infected officers were essentially used
as bloodhounds, relying on any sense of unusual

00:08:53.610 --> 00:08:59.610
familiarity to sniff out new dens of SCP-939
so that they could be captured and contained

00:08:59.610 --> 00:09:01.350
by the foundation.

00:09:01.350 --> 00:09:05.040
As far as we know, this operation is still
ongoing today.

00:09:05.040 --> 00:09:10.149
However, now that the foundation has a sufficient
number of specimens to study, additional dens

00:09:10.149 --> 00:09:14.819
of SCP-939 that are discovered are ordered
to be immediately destroyed.

00:09:14.819 --> 00:09:16.930
As for the SCP-939 still in captivity?

00:09:16.930 --> 00:09:21.649
They are contained in environmentally regulated
and negatively pressurized cells with walls

00:09:21.649 --> 00:09:23.160
of reinforced concrete.

00:09:23.160 --> 00:09:29.040
The doors to the cells are air-tight to prevent
the leakage of any AMN-C227, and any personnel

00:09:29.040 --> 00:09:33.670
that interact with one of the creatures is
required to wear Level C Hazmat gear to avoid

00:09:33.670 --> 00:09:38.500
exposure, and follow decontamination procedures
upon exiting the cell.

00:09:38.500 --> 00:09:44.720
All SCP-939 have subdermal tracking devices
implanted to find them in the event of escape.

00:09:44.720 --> 00:09:49.149
Only one SCP-939 has given birth in the time
that the creatures have been in captivity,

00:09:49.149 --> 00:09:51.360
and only one of the litter survived.

00:09:51.360 --> 00:09:55.920
Strangely, SCP-939 young look indistinguishable
from human infants, and change their physical

00:09:55.920 --> 00:09:59.220
appearance at some yet unknown point as they
age.

00:09:59.220 --> 00:10:03.519
If any more offspring are produced, they will
immediately be separated from the parent and

00:10:03.519 --> 00:10:04.519
studied.

00:10:04.519 --> 00:10:05.519
The SCP foundation has redacted all information
about the location of these creatures or the

00:10:05.519 --> 00:10:06.519
incident involving J.S., refusing to reveal
where their natural habitat is.

00:10:06.519 --> 00:10:09.439
All that we know is that they are found in
caves in the woods outside of a small town.

00:10:09.439 --> 00:10:11.920
It could be any town, even yours.

00:10:11.920 --> 00:10:17.009
Sp if you’re ever out hiking, and are struck
with a sudden feeling of deja vu?

00:10:17.009 --> 00:10:20.420
Don’t investigate, don’t get curious,
just go home.

00:10:20.420 --> 00:10:23.040
It might just save your life.

